        <mxCell id="notes_text" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;spacing=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;Generative AI (not Agentic)&lt;/b&gt; — no autonomous agents;&lt;br&gt;human-initiated prompts → AI generates output.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Double Presidio Protection:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Step 2: Input sanitization (ADO → dummy data)&lt;br&gt;• Step 4: Output sanitization (AI output → verified safe)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;HIPAA Compliance:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• PHI never reaches GPT-4o&lt;br&gt;• Deterministic masking ensures consistency&lt;br&gt;• Full audit trail of all data access&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3 User Personas:&lt;/b&gt; QA Engineers, Doc Writers, Manual Testers&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3 AI Features:&lt;/b&gt; Test Cases, Automation Scripts, User Guides" vertex="1">
