        <mxCell id="tech_text" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;spacing=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;AI:&lt;/b&gt; Azure AI Foundry · GPT-4o · Prompt Flow&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Privacy:&lt;/b&gt; Microsoft Presidio · PII/PHI Engine&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Data:&lt;/b&gt; Azure DevOps REST API · Test Plans API&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Search:&lt;/b&gt; Azure AI Search · Vector Index · RAG&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cache:&lt;/b&gt; Azure Redis Cache · Session + Query&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Storage:&lt;/b&gt; Blob Storage · Cosmos DB · SQL DB&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Messaging:&lt;/b&gt; Azure Service Bus&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Compute:&lt;/b&gt; Azure Container Apps&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CI/CD:&lt;/b&gt; Azure DevOps Pipelines&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Auth:&lt;/b&gt; Entra ID · RBAC · Managed Identity&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Security:&lt;/b&gt; Key Vault · Content Safety&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Observability:&lt;/b&gt; App Insights · Log Analytics&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Interface:&lt;/b&gt; SharePoint · Teams Bot · Web UI" vertex="1">
